Package: mirra-lingua-server
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Linzn <niklas.linz@mirranet.de>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, adduser
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/LinzN/mirra-lingua
Description: Backend server for the MirraLingua language learning app
 Accounts, course delivery and progress sync for the MirraLingua Android
 app (English and French for German speakers, in the style of the early
 Duolingo). Course files are reloaded automatically when they change, so
 new lessons reach the app without an app update.
 .
 Runs as the systemd service "mirra-lingua" on 127.0.0.1:8085; put a TLS
 reverse proxy in front of it. Data lives in /var/lib/mirra-lingua.
